  "description": "A common visual trope in media and political imagery that associates older women with traditional values, conservative viewpoints, or moral authority. In this meme, the image of an elderly woman is juxtaposed with a progressive political message to create an emotional appeal, leveraging the stereotype to frame the issue as a moral imperative that anyone would support for themselves.",
